<title>USA: IPO PRICING - UOL Publishing at $13.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - UOL Publishing at $13.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name     UOL Publishing Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At			     $13</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range     $13-$15</p>
<p>   Number of Shares	 1.43 million</p>
<p>   Underwriters   Friedman Billings Ramsay</p>
<p>   Headquarters     Falls Church, Virginia</p>
<p>NOTE: The company earlier changed the terms of its upcoming initial public offering from its original estimate of 1.334 million shares for $14 to $16 each.</p>
<p>Formerly known as University Online Inc, the Falls Church, Virginia company publishes interactive, on-demand, Web-based courseware for the academic and corporate education markets.</p>
</text>
